WEBVTT

00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:16,220
My daughter is losing hair. Dr. said it was from COVID. He told us to use L methyl folate.

00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:23,740
We also made the hair remedy you mentioned on your site, lavender rosemary, etc.

00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:32,140
My head started itching and so are two more of my kids. I assume that your head started itching

00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:37,260
from the lavender rosemary, you need lady to water it down a little bit more with a

00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:50,300
carrier oil, if that's true. The loss of hair also, I don't think methyl tetrahedral folate

00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:54,620
is really going to be the cure for loss of hair. The other thing you want to look at is

00:00:55,260 --> 00:01:04,060
how it may have affected thyroid. If there's a decrease in thyroid T3,

00:01:04,940 --> 00:01:12,140
T4 production, then you could end up with hair loss. That's one of the symptoms of low

00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:18,940
thyroid. If you do a thyroid test, you want to make sure that you are requesting from your doctor

00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:27,740
a complete thyroid profile because many times they'll just do a TSH test and many times they'll

00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:39,660
do a TSH, a T3 and a T4. That's still inadequate. You need to get three T3, three T4

00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:57,810
and reverse T3 because many times T3 is made and then it's a flip cis isomer of T3 which

00:01:57,810 --> 00:02:09,090
can never flip back to the usable T3. Your thyroid makes T3 and T4. T3 is the active form of the

00:02:09,090 --> 00:02:18,930
hormone but 94, 95% of thyroid hormone is released as T4 and then it's turned into T3 in the gut

00:02:19,490 --> 00:02:31,490
and in the liver. It can be turned into reverse T3 and then a person can have normal TSH and slightly

00:02:31,490 --> 00:02:37,970
low T3, slightly low T4 and really elevated reverse T3 and that's really their problem.

00:02:39,490 --> 00:02:43,410
Then you also want to look and make sure that the person doesn't have

00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:54,290
Hashimoto's and you test for TPO antibodies. That is a more complete

00:02:55,010 --> 00:03:00,770
a thyroid panel that you'll want to ask for so you want to write that down so that's what you're

00:03:00,770 --> 00:03:05,650
asking for. You want to measure her thyroid

